    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRAKE is an isometric-like Action RPG featuring non-linear level exploration and a unique interactive story. Set in a densely crafted Space Western world, it draws inspiration from beloved series like The Mandalorian, Firefly, and Trigun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game delivers a modern twist on classic RPGs. Our narrative approach provides each player with a unique story to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/8540e84f7782f15c48a624ff271938d4.poster.avif?t=1740354088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/8540e84f7782f15c48a624ff271938d4.webm?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/8540e84f7782f15c48a624ff271938d4.mp4?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRAKE IS AN ACTION ROLE-PLAYING GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices influence not only the state of the world and unfolding events but also the personality of your protagonist. This alters gameplay, offering truly immersive character progression and role-playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/0ca5d6a8fe4f3ee73af3666b4a825439.poster.avif?t=1740354088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/0ca5d6a8fe4f3ee73af3666b4a825439.webm?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/0ca5d6a8fe4f3ee73af3666b4a825439.mp4?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRAKE IS A ROAD ADVENTURE</h2>Every major point on the map is more than just a destination; it is part of this planet's backstory and a pivotal moment in your journey. Decide which faction aligns with your worldview and with whom you will join forces as your journey continues.<br><br>What will be your path, Space Cowboy? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/c81156863de601361b0cd9153af6baa5.avif?t=1740354088\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRAKE IS A SPACE WESTERN WORLD</h2>A brand new adventure awaits you, featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CRPG game with a 3D isometric action and consequential choices;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand new story filled with engaging characters and multiple endings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An organic roleplay approach where your story choices change the protagonist;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A distant world teeming with factions and powers to explore;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack to enhance your experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sand that\u2019s coarse and rough and gets everywhere!</p></li></ul></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRAKE is an isometric-like Action RPG featuring non-linear level exploration and a unique interactive story. Set in a densely crafted Space Western world, it draws inspiration from beloved series like The Mandalorian, Firefly, and Trigun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game delivers a modern twist on classic RPGs. Our narrative approach provides each player with a unique story to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/8540e84f7782f15c48a624ff271938d4.poster.avif?t=1740354088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/8540e84f7782f15c48a624ff271938d4.webm?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/8540e84f7782f15c48a624ff271938d4.mp4?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRAKE IS AN ACTION ROLE-PLAYING GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices influence not only the state of the world and unfolding events but also the personality of your protagonist. This alters gameplay, offering truly immersive character progression and role-playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/0ca5d6a8fe4f3ee73af3666b4a825439.poster.avif?t=1740354088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/0ca5d6a8fe4f3ee73af3666b4a825439.webm?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/0ca5d6a8fe4f3ee73af3666b4a825439.mp4?t=1740354088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRAKE IS A ROAD ADVENTURE</h2>Every major point on the map is more than just a destination; it is part of this planet's backstory and a pivotal moment in your journey. Decide which faction aligns with your worldview and with whom you will join forces as your journey continues.<br><br>What will be your path, Space Cowboy? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735880/extras/c81156863de601361b0cd9153af6baa5.avif?t=1740354088\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRAKE IS A SPACE WESTERN WORLD</h2>A brand new adventure awaits you, featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CRPG game with a 3D isometric action and consequential choices;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand new story filled with engaging characters and multiple endings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An organic roleplay approach where your story choices change the protagonist;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A distant world teeming with factions and powers to explore;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack to enhance your experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sand that\u2019s coarse and rough and gets everywhere!</p></li></ul></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Drake Frontier! A Space Western action RPG featuring real-time combat, organic roleplay, and a deep narrative. Meet different factions, friends, and foes, shape your own interactive story and explore the distant planet Drake.",
